[{"id":"1048639383757238273","date":1538850086000,"rawContent":"About #MeToo being hijacked by casual flirting, married men wanting to woo other women, single or otherwise. I wise person told me it is not anyone\u2019s place to take a moral high ground. \nThere is a sleazeball and there is harassment.\nA date going bad ain\u2019t harassment 1\/n","media":null,"username":"Chinmayi","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":1.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":2,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1048641986931056640","date":1538850707000,"rawContent":"However I believe #MeToo cannot be hijacked by screenshots of flirtatious whatsapp conversations and I stand corrected; it is not my place to share private messages; I have always wanted to be the better person and shall remain so.","media":null,"username":"Chinmayi","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":3,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1048643090955755520","date":1538850970000,"rawContent":"Going to the police for such cases is a looong way off.\nWhat we can hope to from the #MeToo movement is that men can no longer get away with entitled behaviour; they dont own the women they work with nor are they doing them a favour by treating them as equals.","media":null,"username":"Chinmayi","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":4,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLiv