e":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":12.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":13,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":12.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1050994608799272960","date":1539411615000,"rawContent":"A \u2018prank\u2019 #MeToo is doing the rounds on Kalyan Master. \nIt is absolutely unfair to smear professionals.\n\nDo NOT support and do not give it credence.","media":null,"username":"Chinmayi","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":13.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":14,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":13.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1051122480604053504","date":1539442102000,"rawContent":"Kalyan Master was named by a victim named \u2018Hema\u2019 for harassment who shares a name with his ex-wife.\n#MeToo is about women &amp; men finally finding a voice. Not for ex-wives\n\/girlfriends to get even. \nSaid victim can go to the media\/authorities with her story. \nI cant support \u2018Hema\u2019","media":null,"username":"Chinmayi","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":14.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":15,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":14.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1052519874394636289","date":1539775267000,"rawContent":"#MeToo #TimesUp has given a voice to victims of sexual abuse and actions against predators from the very society that sought to hush our voices.\nChange is here.","media":null,"username":"Chinmayi","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":15.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":16,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":15.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1053856693358981121","date":1540093990000,"rawContent":"Also - the jokes. The jokes. \u2018If I now shake hands with you, will you yell #MeToo\u2019? \nIt is that funny, is it? \nWomen and so many men finally found the strength to share the stories of sexual misconduct and assault and some men need to joke about it.","media":null,"username":"Chinmayi","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":16.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":17,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":16.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1054023573797568512","date":1540133777000,"rawContent":"A lot of men have already shared how they were raped or sexually assaulted either by a family member or an adult they trust before they were 11. \nThey have already joined #MeToo\nNot to mention Trans People whose daily life includes sexual harassment","media":null,"username":"Chinmayi","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":17.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":18,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":17.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1055049650275676165","date":1540378413000,"rawContent":"Anyway\nThe irony that in 2018 women needed a #MeToo to speak up and still get shamed for it. For 1 of me there are a 1000 others that haven\u2019t spoken up. I know the number of truly anonymous complaints I have not shared from people. \nSociety has enabled predators with our silence","media":null,"username":"Chinmayi","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":18.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":19,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":18.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1056534141838262275","date":1540732343000,"rawContent":"It\u2019s almost as if News7 Tamil has a relentless paid campaign of finding voices that discredit #MeToo and give voices that slutshame victims a platform. \n\nWith due respect to Mrs Vijayakanth, she clearly doesn\u2019t understand intimidation. And doesnt matter if she \u2018accepts\u2019 or not.","media":null,"username":"Chinmayi","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":19.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":20,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":19.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1059178311866294272","date":1541362762000,"rawContent":"Thread by @aruna_sekhar: \"\u201cAll the policies are only for the walls. You have factories full of 2000 women and none of them know who they can pport for migrants who come to work here or sympathy from the police.\u201d [\u2026]\" #metoo #GarmentWorkersSpeak #bangalore https:\/\/t.co\/DKW5wiD5PG","media":null,"username":"Chinmayi","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":20.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":21,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":20.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0}]